{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾行政總裁陳立武（Lip-Bu Tan）近日在華美半導體專業協會（CASPA）於10月24日舉辦的一場爐邊談話中透露，公司正在積極推進先進制程與客户合作戰略。他表示，英特爾不僅將全力爭奪CPU性能領導地位，還正在探索與競爭對手AMD開展合作的潛在機會。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583928.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.105073+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_hash":"1c219fa3e75d70457568943ae68f0e3d98a4482e29958ad0b4a347466a754eda","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}